{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Demo Disclaimer:</i></strong><i>\u00a0The demo is a limited version of the full game, which is still under active development. The goal is to give you a quick introduction to the mechanics in the early stage of the game!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo includes:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign mode with Level Map (2 locations, 15 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 bats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for Round 2? Wanna find out how far one penguin can really fly? Warm up your swing and make the world your fairway!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/5104b28cd61fd46dde2888ef4cd8c3ef.poster.avif?t=1760364016\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/5104b28cd61fd46dde2888ef4cd8c3ef.webm?t=1760364016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/5104b28cd61fd46dde2888ef4cd8c3ef.mp4?t=1760364016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite penguin is back\u2014and the whole world is his runway. Aim with the new \u201cSwing Arc,\u201d click once, and watch him rocket into rag-doll glory. A perfect hit breaks records; a bad one ends in face-plant comedy. Either way, it\u2019s fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/17201c5b0ea9ecae0cef50035e09bbb3.poster.avif?t=1760364016\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/17201c5b0ea9ecae0cef50035e09bbb3.webm?t=1760364016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/17201c5b0ea9ecae0cef50035e09bbb3.mp4?t=1760364016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each launch begins on a branching world map. Choose your route, sniff out secret shortcuts, and pick the mode that fits your mood:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Campaign \u2013 Clear the Level Map node by node, finish unique quests, and unlock every bat, booster, and skin along the way.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Arcade \u2013 Jump into bite-size score runs loaded with random wacky boosters and fresh cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/df2b6543d12ce8b18ae6c9b66fa58537.poster.avif?t=1760364016\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/df2b6543d12ce8b18ae6c9b66fa58537.webm?t=1760364016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/df2b6543d12ce8b18ae6c9b66fa58537.mp4?t=1760364016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh art style powers 10 hand-crafted biomes\u2014Arctic ice, deep Oceans, glowing Mushroom World, cozy Fall forest, wild Jungle, and more. Each zone drops new gadgets, bouncy critters, plus bats and boosters to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/1f706b25b57606deb8ee8a1426d9e85e.poster.avif?t=1760364016\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/1f706b25b57606deb8ee8a1426d9e85e.webm?t=1760364016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/extras/1f706b25b57606deb8ee8a1426d9e85e.mp4?t=1760364016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bronze-to-Diamond leagues reset every month. Distance, speed, or most combos - there\u2019s a leaderboard for it. Climb high, earn exclusive skins, and become the top penguin-launcher on Earth.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Story Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/49c842547f89dce1d6b830a5e70336dfe6460694.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/50d849ca356e143ca2a2f98d26373b3590a4eeae.jpg"},{"name":"GOAT Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/6661ce1ac8216697d89750d823c75e2eaea0aa63.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta Be Fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/ab6c8320133a16a58fb2a99054de37d59eedc03a.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Streak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/3bc0e2b534d416deb57ed305ab04f6e4fb6a6942.jpg"},{"name":"Sky-High Score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/7743ad69bb8f370c67ca55ddf7f20eb039576fc2.jpg"},{"name":"First Kick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/07bc0530c3b3d21e01a781a81517b8e76028fc14.jpg"},{"name":"Kick Centurion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/f826a224316a452cf30f9c4bd8824d96f186501c.jpg"},{"name":"No Wallet Big Enough!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/568909093576bdd7965470905f92efed1aa1cd45.jpg"},{"name":"Groundhog Penguin Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091980/9ddf7e13898debfdf5c68534f5ac41a8931aeeb6.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4091980?t=1760364016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4091980?t=1760364016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/60acc3526f67203e6d7fb27dfbd23529971b4747/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760364016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091980/60acc3526f67203e6d7fb27dfbd23529971b4747/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760364016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Demo Disclaimer:</i></strong><i>\u00a0The demo is a limited version of the full game, which is still under active development. The goal is to give you a quick introduction to the mechanics in the early stage of the game!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo includes:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign mode with Level Map (2 locations, 15 levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 bats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for Round 2? Wanna find out how far one penguin can really fly? Warm up your swing and make the world your fairway!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset